    {
      "id": "claim_b9e9ec5b1b8d4a16a2ea9126c7e200f5",
      "statement": "celld is an open-source daemon that runs Cloudflare Workers and Durable Objects on your own machines; each object is a cell (a named server with its own SQLite database), nodes sharing one bucket form a fleet, and a conditional bucket write gives a node ownership so exactly one node owns a cell at a time with no control plane or consensus service.",
      "evidence": [
