        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_60f110b109874a759caeb7c187172d1f",
      "statement": "The workspace ships release (fat LTO, codegen-units 1, opt-level s, panic=abort, strip) and lab (thin LTO, incremental, unstripped line-tables) profiles; the Dockerfile accepts CELD_PROFILE=lab to skip the fat-LTO relink and keep incremental state in the target cache.",
