      "id": "claim_cf4603a276734fc39ce31543fd8d9e1a",
      "statement": "celld dev starts one node against a local object store in .celld/dev with no Docker or cloud bucket required; the Worker listener defaults to http://127.0.0.1:9876; --port/--host/--logs and NO_COLOR/FORCE_COLOR are honored; the watcher rebuilds on source/config change without killing the running app on a failed build and retains durable state across restarts.",
